/* Link script for a program built by nfcxx that loads libnfconnxsim.so (lib/uop/nfcuop_onnxgrad.cpp):
   pass -Wl,--version-script=scripts/onnxsim/exe.map. nfcxx emits the C++ ABI's type_info vtables (__cxxabiv1::__class_type_info
   and the others) into every program as weak, exported definitions that lack the virtual functions; libstdc++ then binds its
   own exception machinery to them, and any exception thrown inside the library (every unsupported operator is one) crashes in
   the unwinder. With no symbol of the program exported, libstdc++ keeps its own. */
{ local: *; };
